# Cloudflare Pages — vercel.json 의 headers(캐시 규칙)를 옮긴 것(★ 둘 중 하나를 고치면 다른 쪽과 docker/nginx-site.conf 도)
# 늘 새로 확인할 것 — 페이지 · 사이트 스크립트 · 게임 html · 판 표식 · 매니페스트
/home/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=0, must-revalidate
/download/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=0, must-revalidate
/hero.js
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=0, must-revalidate
/showcase.js
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=0, must-revalidate
/content.js
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=0, must-revalidate
/decor.js
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=0, must-revalidate
/i18n.js
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=0, must-revalidate
/style.css
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=0, must-revalidate
/play/
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=0, must-revalidate
/play/index.html
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=0, must-revalidate
/play/version.json
  Cache-Control: no-store
/play/assets/manifest.json
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=0, must-revalidate
# 게임 코드·그림·소리는 ?v= 가 붙어 나가므로 오래 둔다(★ 겹치는 규칙이 있으면 Pages 는 값을 이어 붙인다 — 폴더로 갈라 둔다)
/play/js/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable
/play/css/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable
/play/locales/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable
/play/assets/audio/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable
/play/assets/sound_effects/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable
/play/assets/bg/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable
/play/assets/boss/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable
/play/assets/char/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable
/play/assets/fx/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable
/play/assets/item/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable
/play/assets/npc/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable
/play/assets/obj/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable
/play/assets/tile/*
